{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"{\"thread_id\":\"1792156680.000000\",\"summary\":\"Drew Kim (TUTOR) asked whether the archived reviewer activity counter for queue Q-31 (activity view, not the scoring rubric) includes practice tasks reopened after midnight. Noah Bell (QA_TUTOR) replied that he had not found a definition for the archived counter and asked whether the owner has published a spec. A TEAM_LEAD (U9103) reacted to Noah's reply with an eyes emoji, which is acknowledgment only. No one stated how the counter actually treats reopened practice tasks.\",\"central_question\":\"Does the archived reviewer activity counter in the Q-31 activity view include practice tasks that were reopened after midnight?\",\"resolution_state\":\"UNRESOLVED\",\"authority_evidence_message_ids\":[],\"resolution_rationale\":\"The only reply says no definition has been found and asks whether the owner has published a spec; this is a request for evidence and does not establish whether reopened practice tasks are counted. The TEAM_LEAD's eyes reaction is acknowledgment, not endorsement or an answer, and no eligible authoritative messages exist. The requested inclusion behavior remains unanswered.\",\"confidence\":0.94}","refusal":null,"role":"assistant"}}],"created":0,"id":"msg_011Ch77CqzPUbwxqBgsFDjAv","model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","native_stop":{"stop_details":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn"},"object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":411,"prompt_tokens":4549,"total_tokens":4960}}